How much did Google make from Search in Q3 2026?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;From &lt;a href="https://s206.q4cdn.com/479360582/files/doc_financials/2026/q3/2026q3-alphabet-earnings-release.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Alphabet's Q3 2026 earnings release&lt;/a&gt;, for the three months to 30 September 2026:&lt;/p&gt;

